 level consistently for nearly two full decades. Click to look closer.`,`Inspiration`,[300,166]),p_frame2:zs(`pastel`,`King frame`,`Marc Marquez, 10x World Champion. Click to look closer.`,`Inspiration`,[300,166]),p_frame3:zs(`pastel`,`Sir frame`,`Lewis Hamilton, 7x WDC. Click to look closer.`,`Inspiration`,[300,166]),p_lights:zs(`pastel`,`String lights`,`Warm fairy lights make every deadline friendlier. Click to switch between twinkle, steady and off.`,`Mood`,[250,376]),p_plant:zs(`pastel`,`Desk plant`,`A desk friend that only needs sunlight and a splash of water. Water it a few times and see what happens.`,`Calm`,[152,200])},z.p_switch=zs(`pastel`,`Light switch`,`Click to dim the room. The lamp does the rest. (Flick it five times fast for a surprise.)`,`Mood`,[230,170]),z.p_pbed=zs(`pastel`,`Pet bed`,`A squishy cushion for power naps. Click and the pets curl up in it.`,`Naps`,[350,140]),z.p_bowl=zs(`pastel`,`Food & water`,`Kibble on the left, water on the right. Click to fill the bowl and call everyone for dinner.`,`Snacks`,[140,360]),z.p_toy=zs(`pastel`,`Ball`,`The best toy in the house. Click to start a game.`,`Play`,[270,208]),z.p_mug=zs(`pastel`,`Milk mug`,`A warm mug of milk. Click to take a sip. It refills itself, which is the dream.`,`Fuel`,[175,100]),z.p_desklamp=zs(`pastel`,`Desk lamp`,`A cozy desk lamp for late-night pixel pushing. Click to switch it on or off.`,`Focus`,[100,230]),z.p_clock=zs(`pastel`,`Desk clock`,`Shows your visitor's real local time. Click it to skip ahead to dusk, night or morning.`,`Time`,[200,110]),z.p_sketch=zs(`pastel`,`Sketchbook`,`Where future projects start as raw sketches and unfinished plans. Click to see what's on my mind.`,`Sketches`,[100,230]),z.p_board=zs(`pastel`,`Pinboard`,`A collection of snapshots, quick notes, and key moments from my path. Click to check out my resume.`,`Journey`,[83,300]),z.p_monstera=zs(`pastel`,`Sansevieria`,`This plant features upright, stiff, and slender leaves, and is very low-maintenance rega