Sketches on the train.`},email:{type:D.String,title:`Contact: email`,defaultValue:`jydnahm@gmail.com`,description:`Shown in Mail, the Contact folder and the Hello modal.`},socials:{type:D.Array,title:`Contact: links`,description:`GitHub, LinkedIn, Instagram, anything. Appears in the OS Contact folder, Mail and About.`,control:{type:D.Object,controls:{label:{type:D.String,title:`Label`,defaultValue:`GITHUB`},url:{type:D.Link,title:`Link`}}}},osName:{type:D.String,title:`OS name`,defaultValue:`FolioOS`},iconStyle:{type:D.Enum,title:`OS icons`,options:[`color`,`classic`],optionTitles:[`Colour pixel`,`Classic Mac`],displaySegmentedControl:!0,defaultValue:`color`},intro:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Intro screen`,defaultValue:!0,description:`Hidden on the Framer canvas.`},introTitle:{type:D.String,title:`Intro title`,defaultValue:``,placeholder:`Defaults to your name`,hidden:e=>!e.intro},sections:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Work / About / Hello`,defaultValue:!0},palette:{type:D.Enum,title:`Colours`,options:[`preset`,`custom`],optionTitles:[`Room preset`,`Custom`],displaySegmentedControl:!0,defaultValue:`preset`},wall:{type:D.Color,title:`Walls`,defaultValue:`#c9c3bd`,hidden:e=>e.palette!==`custom`},floor:{type:D.Color,title:`Floor`,defaultValue:`#cfd6e4`,hidden:e=>e.palette!==`custom`},wood:{type:D.Color,title:`Desk / wood`,defaultValue:`#a8683c`,hidden:e=>e.palette!==`custom`},accent:{type:D.Color,title:`Accent`,defaultValue:`#5aa0ff`,hidden:e=>e.palette!==`custom`},bg:{type:D.Color,title:`Background`,defaultValue:`#f3ece3`,hidden:e=>e.palette!==`custom`},mood:{type:D.Enum,title:`Light`,options:[`day`,`sunset`,`night`,`auto`],optionTitles:[`Day`,`Sunset`,`Night`,`Auto (visitor's clock)`],defaultValue:`sunset`},weather:{type:D.Enum,title:`Weather`,options:[`clear`,`rain`,`snow`],optionTitles:[`Clear`,`Rain`,`Snow`],displaySegmentedControl:!0,defaultValue:`clear`,description:`Visitors can change it by clicking the window.`},pet:{type:D.Enum,title:`Pet`,options:Zl,optionTitles:Ql,defaultValue:`cat`},pet2:{type:D.Enum,title:`Second pet`,options:Zl,optionTitles:Ql,defaultValue:`none`},petName:{type:D.String,title:`Pet name`,defaultValue:``,placeholder:`Miso, Biscuit, Mochi...`,hidden:e=>e.pet===`none`},pet2Name:{type:D.String,title:`Pet 2 name`,defaultValue:``,placeholder:`Second pet's name`,hidden:e=>e.pet2===`none`},paintingImage:{type:D.ResponsiveImage,title:`Salon painting`,description:`Replaces the portrait by the wall candle. Hosted images need CORS to appear in the pixel room.`},paintingTitle:{type:D.String,title:`Painting title`,defaultValue:`Dusk at sea`},easelImage:{type:D.ResponsiveImage,title:`Easel painting`,description:`Shown on the Salon easel. Leave empty for the built-in canvases.`},paintingNote:{type:D.String,title:`Painting note`,displayTextArea:!0,defaultValue:`A favourite piece.`},readingList:{type:D.Array,title:`Reading list`,description:`Shown when visitors open the Salon's china cabinet.`,control:{type:D.Object,controls:{title:{type:D.String,title:`Title`,defaultValue:`Book title`},author:{type:D.String,title:`Author`,defaultValue:``},status:{type:D.Enum,title:`Status`,options:[`reading`,`next`,`done`],optionTitles:[`In progress`,`To read`,`Done`],defaultValue:`next`},progress:{type:D.Number,title:`Progress %`,min:0,max:100,step:5,defaultValue:0,hidden:e=>e.status!==`reading`},quote:{type:D.String,title:`Favourite quote`,displayTextArea:!0,defaultValue:``},note:{type:D.String,title:`Note`,defaultValue:``},link:{type:D.Link,title:`Link`}}},defaultValue:ol},chatIntro:{type:D.String,title:`Chat: greeting`,displayTextArea:!0,defaultValue:``,placeholder:`Hi! Pick a question below...`,description:`First message in the Chatbox. Leave empty for the default.`},references:{type:D.Array,title:`Chat: references`,description:`Quotes from people you've worked with. Shown in the Chatbox (the OS app and the envelope on the Salon window).`,control:{type:D.Object,controls:{name:{type:D.String,title:`Name`,defaultValue:``},role:{type:D.String,title:`Role / company`,defaultValue:``},quote:{type:D.String,title:`Quote`,displayTextArea:!0,defaultValue:``},link:{type:D.Link,title:`Link`}}},defaultValue:jl},faqs:{type:D.Array,title:`Chat: FAQs`,description:`Each question becomes a quick-reply button. Visitors tap it and you answer.`,control:{type:D.Object,controls:{q:{type:D.String,title:`Question`,defaultValue:``},a:{type:D.String,title:`Answer`,displayTextArea:!0,defaultValue:``}}},defaultValue:Ml},resumeUrl:{type:D.Link,title:`Resume: link`,description:`Your resume as a PDF or page. Shown on the Salon notebook and in the Chatbox.`},resumeText:{type:D.String,title:`Resume: text`,displayTextArea:!0,description:`Shown in the notebook. Use '# Section', 'Role | Company | Dates' and '- bullet' lines.`,defaultValue:Nl},goodreadsUrl:{type:D.Link,title:`Reading list: Goodreads`,description:`Your Goodreads profile or shelf. Adds a Goodreads button to the Salon reading list.`},trinkets:{type:D.Array,title:`Trinket dish`,description:`Fun keepsakes in the little dish on the Salon mantel. Visitors tap one to see what it is for.`,control:{type:D.Object,controls:{icon:{type:D.Enum,title:`Icon`,options:[`key`,`carkey`,`keychain`,`coin`,`watch`,`pin`,`dice`,`shell`],optionTitles:[`House key`,`Car key`,`Keychain charm`,`Lucky coin`,`Pocket watch`,`Enamel pin`,`Dice`,`Seashell`],defaultValue:`key`},name:{type:D.String,title:`Name`,defaultValue:``},purpose:{type:D.String,title:`What it's for`,displayTextArea:!0,defaultValue:``}}},defaultValue:Pl},pixelFont:{type:D.Enum,title:`Pixel font`,options:[`pixelify`,`silkscreen`,`vt323`,`press`,`dotgothic`,`jersey`,`tiny5`,`handjet`,`custom`],optionTitles:[`Pixelify Sans`,`Silkscreen`,`VT323`,`Press Start 2P`,`DotGothic16`,`Jersey 10`,`Tiny5`,`Handjet`,`Custom (any Google font)`],defaultValue:`pixelify`,description:`Used for every label, popover, modal and the OS.`},customFont:{type:D.String,title:`Custom font name`,defaultValue:``,placeholder:`e.g. Bitcount Single`,hidden:e=>e.pixelFont!==`custom`,description:`Any Google Fonts family name.`},playlist:{type:D.Array,title:`Playlist`,description:`YouTube links only you set. Each can be a playlist or a single song. Visitors play them from the gramophone or the Music app; audio only.`,control:{type:D.Object,controls:{title:{type:D.String,title:`Name`,defaultValue:``},url:{type:D.String,title:`YouTube link`,defaultValue:``,placeholder:`https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=...`}}},defaultValue:[]},frameStyle:{type:D.Enum,title:`Picture frame`,options:[`gold`,`walnut`,`ebony`,`ivory`,`rose`,`silver`,`custom`],optionTitles:[`Gold`,`Walnut`,`Ebony`,`Ivory`,`Rose gold`,`Silver`,`Custom colour`],defaultValue:`gold`},frameColor:{type:D.Color,title:`Frame colour`,defaultValue:`#e0b050`,hidden:e=>e.frameStyle!==`custom`},petHue:{type:D.Number,title:`Pet colour`,min:-180,max:180,step:10,defaultValue:0,description:`Shifts the pet's colours. 0 is natural.`,hidden:e=>e.pet===`none`},petAccessory:{type:D.Enum,title:`Pet outfit`,options:[`none`,`bow`,`hat`,`crown`,`scarf`,`glasses`],optionTitles:[`None`,`Bow`,`Party hat`,`Crown`,`Scarf`,`Sunglasses`],defaultValue:`none`,hidden:e=>e.pet===`none`},pet2Hue:{type:D.Number,title:`Pet 2 colour`,min:-180,max:180,step:10,defaultValue:0,hidden:e=>e.pet2===`none`},pet2Accessory:{type:D.Enum,title:`Pet 2 outfit`,options:[`none`,`bow`,`hat`,`crown`,`scarf`,`glasses`],optionTitles:[`None`,`Bow`,`Party hat`,`Crown`,`Scarf`,`Sunglasses`],defaultValue:`none`,hidden:e=>e.pet2===`none`},petScale:{type:D.Number,title:`Pet size`,min:.6,max:2,step:.1,defaultValue:1,hidden:e=>e.pet===`none`&&e.pet2===`none`},petFollow:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Pets visit`,defaultValue:!0,description:`Pets trot over to whatever you hover.`},music:{type:D.File,title:`Music`,allowedFileTypes:[`mp3`,`wav`,`ogg`,`m4a`],description:`Optional. Leave empty for the built-in lo-fi loop.`},musicOnEnter:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Play on enter`,defaultValue:!1},items:{type:D.Array,title:`Object overrides`,description:`Optional. Every object already has text and an action; add one here to change it.`,control:{type:D.Object,controls:{object:{type:D.Enum,title:`Object`,options:Hs,optionTitles:Us,defaultValue:`p_monitor`},action:{type:D.Enum,title:`On click`,options:[`default`,`tip`,`os`,`project`,`gallery`,`about`,`contact`,`light`,`weather`,`art`,`books`,`curtain`,`resume`,`chat`,`trinkets`],optionTitles:[`Default for this object`,`Info card only`,`Boot the OS`,`Open as a project`,`Work gallery`,`About me`,`Contact`,`Dim the room`,`Change weather`,`Painting viewer`,`Reading list`,`Open / close curtains`,`Resume`,`Chatbox`,`Trinket dish`],defaultValue:`default`},title:{type:D.String,title:`Title`,defaultValue:``},use:{type:D.String,title:`Text`,displayTextArea:!0,defaultValue:Ws},tags:{type:D.String,title:`Tags`,description:`Comma separated`,defaultValue:``},link:{type:D.Link,title:`Link`},image:{type:D.ResponsiveImage,title:`Image`,description:`Used by “Open as a project”.`}}}},builtIn:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Built-in text`,defaultValue:!0,description:`Off = only objects listed above are interactive.`},ambient:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Floating specks`,defaultValue:!0},sound:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Click sounds`,defaultValue:!1},hints:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Hint markers`,defaultValue:!0},chips:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Object chips`,defaultValue:!1},lightButton:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Dim button`,defaultValue:!0},moodButton:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Time button`,defaultValue:!0},petButton:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Pet button`,defaultValue:!0},musicButton:{type:D.Boolean,title:`Music button`,defaultValue:!0},caption:{type:D.String,title:`Caption`,defaultValue:`Click the computer, shelves, lamp and curtains.`}}),$l=e=>{let t=[`x...x`,`.x.x.`,`..x..`,`.x.x.`,`x...x`],n=``;t.forEach((e,t)=>e.split(``).forEach((e,r)=>{e===`x`&&(n+=`<rect x='${r}' y='${t}' width='1' height='1'/>`)}));let r=`<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 5 5' shape-rendering='crispEdges' fill='${e}'>${n}</svg>`;return`url("data:image/svg+xml,${encodeURIComponent(r)}")`},eu=$l(`#ffffff`),tu=`
.wr { position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 640 / 560; overflow: hidden; container-type: inline-size; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; touch-action: pan-y; font-family: ${R}; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }

/* ui */
@keyframes wr-blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }
.wr-cap { position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 10px; z-index: 3; max-width: 60%; padding: 4px 7px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 14px; color: #2a2438; background: rgba(255,255,255,.85); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438, 3px 3px 0 2px rgba(42,36,56,.25); pointer-events: none; animation: wr-in .3s steps(4) backwards; }
.wr-mood { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 8px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font: 400 8px/10px ${As}; color: #2a2438; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438, 3px 3px 0 2px rgba(42,36,56,.25); }
.wr-mood:active { transform: translate(1px,1px); }
.wr-mood i { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffb340; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438; }
.wr-mood i[data-m="night"] { background: #5b6cff; }
.wr-mood i[data-m="day"] { background: #ffe066; }
.wr-tip { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; z-index: 4; width: 210px; max-width: calc(100% - 12px); padding: 8px 10px 9px; color: #2a2438; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438, 4px 4px 0 2px rgba(42,36,56,.28); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity .12s steps(2); }
.wr-tip[data-on] { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; animation: wr-in .22s steps(4) backwards; }
@keyframes wr-in { from { opacity: 0; margin-top: 6px; } }
.wr-th { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.wr-th b { font: 400 9px/12px ${As}; color: #2a2438; padding-left: 10px; background: linear-gradient(var(--ac), var(--ac)) 0 50% / 6px 6px no-repeat; }
.wr-th button { position: relative; flex: none; width: 16px; height: 16px; padding: 0; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0; background: #2a2438 ${eu} center / 10px 10px no-repeat; image-rendering: pixelated; touch-action: manipulation; }
.wr-th button:hover { background-color: var(--ac); }
.wr-th button::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -8px; }
.wr-tip p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 16px; }
.wr-tg { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-top: 7px; }
.wr-tg span { padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: var(--acink); background: var(--ac); }
.wr-ln2 { display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; padding: 4px 8px; font: 400 8px/10px ${As}; color: #fff; background: #2a2438; text-decoration: none; }
.wr-ln2:hover { background: var(--ac); color: var(--acink); }
.wr-chips { position: absolute; left: 8px; right: 8px; bottom: 8px; z-index: 3; display: flex; gap: 5px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 3px 3px 6px; scrollbar-width: none; }
.wr-chips::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.wr-chips button { flex: none; padding: 4px 8px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font: 400 12px/14px ${R}; color: #2a2438; background: rgba(255,255,255,.9); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438; transition: transform .12s steps(2); }
.wr-chips button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
.wr-chips button[data-on] { color: var(--acink); background: var(--ac); }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .wr *, .wr *::before, .wr *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; } }

@keyframes wr-bt { 50% { filter: brightness(.82); } }

/* fx layer, specks, toolbar */
.wr-fxl { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 5; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }
.wr-pt { position: absolute; font: 400 14px/1 ${R}; text-shadow: 1px 0 #2a2438, -1px 0 #2a2438, 0 1px #2a2438, 0 -1px #2a2438; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); animation: wr-pt 1s steps(10) forwards; }
@keyframes wr-pt { to { transform: translate(calc(-50% + var(--dx)), calc(-50% - 46px)); opacity: 0; } }
.wr-amb { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 2; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }
.wr-amb i { position: absolute; width: 3px; height: 3px; background: #fff; opacity: 0; animation: wr-spk 7s linear infinite; }
.wr-amb[data-m="sunset"] i { background: #fff0d0; }
.wr-amb[data-m="night"] i { background: #ffe98a; box-shadow: 0 0 6px 2px rgba(255,233,138,.7); }
@keyframes wr-spk { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(0,0); } 20%, 80% { opacity: .85; } 100% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(18px,-26px); } }
.wr-amb[data-snow] i { background: #fff; box-shadow: none; animation-name: wr-snw; }
@keyframes wr-snw { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(0,-24px); } 20%, 80% { opacity: .9; } 100% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-10px,40px); } }
.wr-bar { position: absolute; right: 10px; top: 10px; z-index: 3; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 7px; }
.wr-mood i { flex: none; }

/* ---- v3: roomfolio ---- */
.wr-zoom { position: absolute; inset: 0; transform-origin: 0 0; transition: transform .7s cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.2,1); }
.wr-cta { margin-top: 7px; font: 400 8px/10px ${As}; color: var(--ac); filter: brightness(.7); }
.wr-mood i[data-eq] { background: var(--ac); animation: wr-bt 0.5s steps(2) infinite; }
.wr-nav { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 10px; z-index: 3; display: flex; gap: 8px; transform: translateX(-50%); }
.wr-nav button { padding: 7px 12px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font: 400 9px/11px ${As}; color: #2a2438; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438, 3px 3px 0 2px rgba(42,36,56,.25); transition: transform .12s steps(2); }
.wr-nav button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); color: var(--acink); background: #dda15e; }

.wr-intro { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 30; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #fff; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ac) 22%, #1d1830); }
.wr-intro b { font: 400 16px/22px ${As}; text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #2a2438; }
.wr-intro em { font: 400 15px/18px ${R}; font-style: normal; opacity: .85; }
.wr-intro small { font: 400 12px/14px ${R}; opacity: .6; }
.wr-intro button { padding: 9px 14px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font: 400 10px/12px ${As}; color: var(--acink); background: var(--ac); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #fff, 4px 4px 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
.wr-intro button:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }
.wr-intro[data-out] { animation: wr-out .5s steps(5) forwards; pointer-events: none; }
@keyframes wr-out { to { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.06); } }
.wr-bar2 { width: min(260px, 70%); height: 14px; padding: 2px; border: 2px solid #fff; }
.wr-bar2 i { display: block; width: 0; height: 100%; background: var(--ac); animation: wr-ld 1.2s steps(12) forwards; }
@keyframes wr-ld { to { width: 100%; } }

/* modal */
.wr-mod { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 2147483000; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 16px; font-family: ${R}; color: #2a2438; background: rgba(18,12,36,.58); animation: wr-mi .25s steps(4) backwards; }
@keyframes wr-mi { from { opacity: 0; } }
.wr-mbox { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: min(520px, 100%); max-height: 100%; outline: none; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.55); animation: wr-mp .3s steps(5) backwards; }
@keyframes wr-mp { from { transform: translateY(14px) scale(.96); } }
.wr-mb { padding: 16px; overflow: auto; font: 400 15px/20px ${R}; color: #000; }
.wr-mb .wr-tg span, .wr-wb .wr-tg span { color: #000; background: #fff; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #000; }
.wr-mod[data-k="os"] .wr-mbox { width: min(1000px, 100%); height: min(700px, 100%); padding: 20px 20px 40px; border: 0; border-radius: 22px; background: #14213d; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px #f4efe0, inset 0 -6px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.12), 0 0 0 3px #3b3629, 10px 10px 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
.wr-bz { position: relative; flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; }
.wr-bzb { position: absolute; left: 28px; right: 28px; bottom: 11px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; color: #e5e5e5; font: 400 10px/12px ${As}; }
.wr-bzb i { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #7fe0b0; box-shadow: 0 0 6px #7fe0b0; animation: wr-blink 2s steps(1) infinite; }
.wr-bz .wr-os { border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #2b2619, inset 0 0 0 2px #000; }

/* shared content */
.wr-pv h3, .wr-av h3, .wr-ml h3 { margin: 12px 0 6px; font: 400 12px/18px ${As}; }
.wr-pv p, .wr-av p { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 20px; text-align: justify; }
.wr-pvi { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; height: 150px; background-size: cover; background-position: center; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438; }
.wr-pvi span { font: 400 26px ${As}; color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3); }
.wr-pvb { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 12px; }
.wr-pvb button, .button-like { padding: 5px 9px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font: 400 8px/10px ${As}; color: #fff; background: #2a2438; }
.wr-pvb em, .wr-av em { font-style: normal; font-size: 13px; opacity: .65; }
.wr-ln2 { border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
.wr-so { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; }
.wr-avh { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.wr-avh h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; }
.wr-avp { flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 64px; height: 64px; background: var(--ac) center / cover; color: var(--acink); font: 400 24px ${As}; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438, 3px 3px 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,.25); }
.wr-avh + p { margin-top: 12px; }
.wr-av ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19px; }
.wr-av li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
.wr-ml label { display: block; margin-top: 8px; font: 400 8px/10px ${As}; }
.wr-ml input, .wr-ml textarea { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 4px; padding: 5px 7px; font: 400 14px/18px ${R}; color: #2a2438; background: #f6f3fb; border: 0; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #2a2438; box-sizing: border-box; resize: vertical; }
.wr-ml input:focus, .wr-ml textarea:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--ac); }

/* OS (classic mac) */
.wr-os { position: relative; flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 12px; color: #000; font: 400 14px/16px ${R}; container-type: inline-size; user-select: none; transform-origin: 50% 50%; background: repeating-conic-gradient(color-mix(in srgb, var(--ac) 38%, #fff) 0 25%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ac) 62%, #fff) 0 50%) 0 0 / 4px 4px; }
.wr-os::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 90; pointer-events: none; border-radius: 12px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,.07) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px); box-shadow: inset 0 0 60px rgba(0,0,0,.3); }
.wr-os[data-s="on"] { animation: wr-crton .9s steps(12) backwards; }
.wr-os[data-s="off"] { animation: wr-croff .8s steps(10) forwards; }
@keyframes wr-crton { 0% { transform: scale(.2,.005); filter: brightness(6); } 35% { transform: scale(1,.005); filter: brightness(5); } 65% { transform: scale(1,1.03); filter: brightness(1.8); } 100% { transform: none; filter: none; } }
@keyframes wr-croff { 0% { transform: none; filter: none; } 40% { transform: scale(1,.01); filter: brightness(4); } 75% { transform: scale(.02,.01); filter: brightness(8); } 100% { transform: scale(0,0); opacity: 0; } }
.wr-mn { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; z-index: 70; display: flex; align-items: center; height: 26px; padding: 0 4px; background: #fff; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; font: 400 15px/22px ${R}; }
.wr-mn .sp { flex: 1; }
.wr-mn > span { padding: 0 8px; }
.wr-mi { position: relative; }
.wr-mi > button { display: block; height: 24px; padding: 0 9px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; color: #000; background: transparent; font: inherit; }
.wr-mi > button[data-on], .wr-mi > button:hover { color: #fff; background: #000; }
.wr-mi > button[data-on] .wr-px, .wr-mi > button:hover .wr-px { filter: invert(1); }
.wr-mi .wr-px { margin: 3px 0; }
.wr-mbk { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 65; }
.wr-menu { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 24px; z-index: 75; min-width: 240px; white-space: nowrap; padding: 2px 0; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #000; }
.wr-menu button { display: block; width: 100%; padding: 2px 16px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; color: #000; background: none; font: 400 14px/18px ${R}; }
.wr-menu button:hover:not(:disabled) { color: #fff; background: #000; }
.wr-menu button:disabled { color: #999; cursor: default; }
.wr-menu hr { margin: 3px 0; border: 0; border-top: 2px dotted #000; }
.wr-desk { position: absolute; inset: 26px 0 0 0; }
.wr-ics { position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 10px; bottom: 50px; right: 110px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: repeat(auto-fill, 78px); grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 88px; align-content: start; pointer-events: none; }
.wr-ic { pointer-events: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 3px; width: 84px; padding: 0; border: 0; cursor: pointer; color: #000; background: none; }
.wr-ic .l { max-width: 92px; padding: 0 3px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; background: #fff; font: 400 13px/15px ${R}; }
.wr-ic:hover .l, .wr-ic:focus-visible .l { color: #fff; background: #000; }
.wr-ic:active .wr-px { filter: invert(1); }
.wr-px { display: block; flex: none; background-size: 100% 100%; background-repeat: no-repeat; image-rendering: pixelated; }
.wr-hdk { position: absolute; right: 10px; top: 10px; }
.wr-trs { position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 46px; }
.wr-w2 { position: absolute; display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 400px; max-width: calc(100% - 8px); max-height: calc(100% - 8px); background: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #000; animation: wr-mp .2s steps(3) backwards; }
.wr-w2[data-k="finder"] { width: 440px; }
.wr-w2[data-k="piano"] { width: 430px; }
.wr-w2[data-k="music"] { width: 290px; }
.wr-w2[data-k="trash"] { width: 270px; }
.wr-w2[data-k="aboutmac"] { width: 400px; }
.wr-wt { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none; height: 24px; padding: 0 26px; cursor: grab; touch-action: none; background: #fff; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; }
.wr-wt:active { cursor: grabbing; }
.wr-w2[data-act] .wr-wt, .wr-wt[data-act] { background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ac) 55%, #000) 0 2px, #fff 2px 4px); }
.wr-wt b { position: relative; padding: 0 9px; background: #fff; font: 400 14px/20px ${R}; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; max-width: 100%; }
.wr-cb, .wr-zb { position: absolute; top: 4px; width: 16px; height: 16px; padding: 0; border: 2px solid #000; border-radius: 0; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; box-sizing: border-box; }
.wr-cb { left: 6px; }
.wr-zb { right: 6px; }
.wr-zb::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 2px; top: 2px; width: 5px; height: 5px; border: 1px solid #000; }
.wr-wb { flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow: auto; padding: 12px; font: 400 14px/18px ${R}; color: #000; user-select: text; }
.wr-wb p { margin: 0; }
.wr-wb::-webkit-scrollbar, .wr-mb::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 15px; height: 15px; }
.wr-wb::-webkit-scrollbar-track, .wr-mb::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: repeating-conic-gradient(#000 0 25%, #fff 0 50%) 0 0 / 2px 2px; border-left: 2px solid #000; }
.wr-wb::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb, .wr-mb::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; }
.wr-rz { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; width: 15px; height: 15px; cursor: nwse-resize; touch-action: none; background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 45%, #000 45% 55%, transparent 55% 70%, #000 70% 80%, transparent 80%); }
.wr-fh { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; font-size: 13px; }
.wr-fh em { flex: 1; text-align: right; font-style: normal; opacity: .65; }
.wr-fg { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(84px, 1fr)); gap: 12px 4px; }
.wr-emp { padding: 14px 0; text-align: center; opacity: .6; }
.wr-cs { position: absolute; left: 8px; bottom: 8px; z-index: 60; display: flex; gap: 2px; padding: 3px; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000; }
.wr-cs button { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 28px; height: 28px; padding: 0; border: 0; cursor: pointer; background: none; }
.wr-cs button:hover { background: #000; }
.wr-cs button:hover .wr-px { filter: invert(1); }
.wr-pgr { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 8px; z-index: 60; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 4px 8px; transform: translateX(-50%); background: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000; font-size: 13px; }
.wr-pgr .wr-bt { height: 22px; padding: 0 8px; }
.wr-pgw { font-style: normal; }
.wr-pxn { position: absolute; z-index: 4; transform: translate(-50%, -100%); white-space: nowrap; padding: 2px 5px; font: 400 8px/10px ${As}; color: #2a2438; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0; transition: opacity .25s steps(3); }
.wr-mod[data-k="art"] .wr-mbox { width: min(420px, 100%); }
.wr-mod[data-k="books"] .wr-mbox { width: min(470px, 100%); }
.wr-pnt { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-align: center; }
.wr-pntf { padding: 8px; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #c79a45, 0 0 0 5px #000; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }
.wr-pntc { display: block; width: 180px; max-width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 40 / 68; image-rendering: pixelated; }
.wr-pntf img { display: block; max-width: 100%; max-height: 52vh; }
.wr-pntf[data-empty] { padding: 30px 18px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px; }
.wr-pnt h3 { margin: 6px 0 0; font: 700 16px/20px ${R}; }
.wr-pnt p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; }
.wr-bk { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
.wr-bkt { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }
.wr-bkt button { height: 24px; padding: 0 8px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; color: #000; font: 400 13px/1 ${R}; cursor: pointer; }
.wr-bkt button[data-on] { background: #000; color: #fff; }
.wr-bk ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0 4px 3px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; max-height: 50vh; overflow: auto; }
.wr-bk li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 8px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000; }
.wr-bk li > div { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; }
.wr-bk li b { font-size: 14px; line-height: 16px; }
.wr-bk li span, .wr-bk li em { font-size: 12px; line-height: 14px; font-style: normal; opacity: .75; }
.wr-bks { flex: none; width: 10px; height: 36px; border: 2px solid #000; }
.wr-bk li u { flex: none; text-decoration: none; font-size: 10px; line-height: 12px; padding: 2px 4px; border: 2px solid #000; background: var(--ac); color: var(--acink); }
.wr-bk li[data-s="done"] u { background: #fff; color: #000; }
.wr-bk li a { flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; border: 2px solid #000; color: #000; text-decoration: none; }
.wr-bk li a:hover { background: #000; color: #fff; }
.wr-bke { margin: 6px 0; font-size: 13px; }
.wr-w2[data-k="music"] { width: 340px; }
.wr-mp { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }
.wr-mpl { padding: 8px 9px 9px; background: #b9cba3; color: #1d2a17; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: inset 2px 2px 0 rgba(29, 42, 23, .28); }
.wr-mpt { overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; padding-bottom: 4px; border-bottom: 2px solid #1d2a17; }
.wr-mpt span { display: inline-block; }
.wr-mpt span[data-run] { animation: wr-mq 14s linear infinite; }
@keyframes wr-mq { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }
.wr-mps { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 14px; }
.wr-mpl .wr-eq { height: 36px; gap: 3px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 6px; }
.wr-mpl .wr-eq i { width: 10px; background: #1d2a17; box-shadow: none; }
.wr-mpl .wr-eq[data-on] i { animation-name: wr-eqm; }
@keyframes wr-eqm { from { height: 4px; } to { height: 34px; } }
.wr-mpb { height: 12px; margin-top: 7px; border: 2px solid #1d2a17; cursor: pointer; touch-action: none; }
.wr-mpb i { display: block; height: 100%; background: #1d2a17; }
.wr-mpc { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2.6fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; align-items: stretch; }
.wr-mpc .wr-bt, .wr-mpc .wr-bt[data-def] { height: 34px; margin: 0; padding: 0; box-shadow: none; min-width: 0; font-size: 13px; }
.wr-bt:disabled { opacity: .4; cursor: default; }
.wr-bt:disabled:hover { color: #000; background: #fff; }
.wr-bt[data-on] { color: #fff; background: #000; }
.wr-mpv { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
.wr-mpv input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; height: 12px; margin: 0; appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
.wr-mpv input::-webkit-slider-thumb { -webkit-appearance: none; width: 10px; height: 18px; background: #000; border: 0; border-radius: 0; }
.wr-mpv input::-moz-range-thumb { width: 10px; height: 18px; background: #000; border: 0; border-radius: 0; }
.wr-mpi { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
.wr-mpi input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; height: 30px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 7px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; color: #000; font: 400 13px/1 ${R}; border-radius: 0; }
.wr-mpe { margin: 0; padding: 4px 6px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #ffe0e0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 15px; }
.wr-mph { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 15px; opacity: .8; }
.wr-mpr { padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; color: inherit; font: inherit; text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer; }
.wr-mpo { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 2px dashed #000; font-size: 12px; }
.wr-mpo .wr-bt { height: 26px; padding: 0 8px; font-size: 12px; }
.wr-yth { position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 0; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; opacity: .01; pointer-events: none; }

.wr-lib { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-content: flex-start; column-gap: 3px; row-gap: 8px; padding: 12px 12px 0; min-height: 156px; max-height: 44vh; overflow: auto; box-sizing: border-box; border: 3px solid #3b2230; background: linear-gradient(#2a1d33, #3a2a44); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #c79a45, 4px 4px 0 #000; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0 148px, #c79a45 148px 150px, #5a3446 150px 158px), linear-gradient(#2a1d33, #3a2a44); background-size: 100% 158px, 100% 100%; background-attachment: local; background-position: 0 12px, 0 0; }
.wr-libw { position: relative; }
.wr-bkt { align-items: center; }
.wr-bkt .wr-gr { margin-left: auto; height: 26px; padding: 0 10px; font-size: 12px; }
.wr-tr { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
.wr-trg { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; padding: 10px; background: #f4f1ea repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,.035) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #000; }
.wr-trg button { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 8px 4px 6px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; color: #000; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000; font: 400 12px/14px ${R}; touch-action: manipulation; }
.wr-trg button span { max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.wr-trg button:hover, .wr-trg button[data-on] { background: var(--ac); color: var(--acink); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 2px 4px 0 #000; }
.wr-trd { padding: 10px 12px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fffdf2; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.4); animation: wr-chin .18s steps(3) backwards; }
.wr-trd h4 { margin: 0 0 6px; font: 400 10px/14px ${As}; }
.wr-trd p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 20px; }
.wr-mod[data-k="trinkets"] .wr-mbox { width: min(440px, 100%); }
.wr-w2[data-k="trinkets"] { width: 380px; }
.wr-bkt2 { position: fixed; z-index: 2147483000; max-width: 220px; min-width: 90px; padding: 6px 8px; transform: translate(-50%, -100%); pointer-events: none; text-align: center; color: #000; background: #fffdf2; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.5); animation: wr-tipin .12s steps(2) backwards; }
@keyframes wr-tipin { from { opacity: 0; } }
.wr-bkt2[data-b] { transform: translate(-50%, 0); }
.wr-bkt2 b { display: block; font: 400 13px/16px ${R}; }
.wr-bkt2 span { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font: 400 12px/14px ${R}; opacity: .7; }
.wr-bkt2 u { display: inline-block; margin-top: 4px; padding: 1px 4px; text-decoration: none; font: 400 9px/12px ${R}; background: var(--ac); color: var(--acink); border: 1px solid #000; }
.wr-spw { flex: none; height: 148px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; }
.wr-spn { position: relative; width: 100%; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0; cursor: pointer; background: linear-gradient(transparent 0 8px, #e2b25a 8px 10px, transparent 10px calc(100% - 10px), #e2b25a calc(100% - 10px) calc(100% - 8px), transparent calc(100% - 8px)), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.18) 0 3px, transparent 3px calc(100% - 4px), rgba(0,0,0,.28) calc(100% - 4px)), var(--c); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #14091a; color: #fff6dc; transition: transform .12s steps(2); }
.wr-spn span { display: block; position: absolute; inset: 14px 0; writing-mode: vertical-rl; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; font: 400 12px/30px ${R}; padding: 0 1px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.45); }
.wr-spn:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.wr-spn[data-sel] { transform: translateY(-12px); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #14091a, 0 0 0 4px #ffd36a; }
.wr-spn[data-s="reading"]::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -6px; width: 8px; height: 10px; margin-left: -4px; background: #d9475e; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #14091a; }
.wr-spn[data-s="done"]::after { content: "★"; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 1px; font-size: 9px; line-height: 10px; text-align: center; color: #ffd36a; }
.wr-bkd { padding: 10px 12px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #000; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.wr-bkdhead { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; }
.wr-bkdcol { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; }
.wr-bkdico { flex: none; width: 40px; height: 40px; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 2px solid #000; background-color: var(--ac); background-position: center; background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; color: var(--acink); font-size: 20px; line-height: 1; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000; image-rendering: pixelated; overflow: hidden; padding: 2px; }
.wr-bkdico.has-logo { background-color: #fff; color: transparent; }
.wr-bkd h4 { margin: 0; font: 700 15px/18px ${R}; }
.wr-bkd > em { font-style: normal; font-size: 12px; opacity: .7; }
.wr-bkg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
.wr-bkg u { flex: none; text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 5px; border: 2px solid #000; background: var(--ac); color: var(--acink); font-size: 11px; line-height: 12px; }
.wr-bkd[data-s="done"] .wr-bkg u { background: #fff; color: #000; }
.wr-bkp { flex: 1; height: 12px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; }
.wr-bkp i { display: block; height: 100%; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #000 0 6px, #fff 6px 8px); }
.wr-bkd blockquote { margin: 2px 0 0; padding: 6px 10px; border-left: 4px solid var(--ac); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ac) 12%, #fff); font-size: 14px; line-height: 19px; }
.wr-bkd blockquote::before { content: "“"; margin-right: 2px; }
.wr-bkd blockquote::after { content: "”"; margin-left: 2px; }
.wr-bkd p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px; }
.wr-bkd .wr-bkq { opacity: .65; }
.wr-bkd .wr-bt { align-self: flex-start; height: 26px; font-size: 12px; }
.wr-bkh { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; opacity: .7; text-align: center; }
.wr-mpq { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; max-height: 118px; overflow: auto; }
.wr-mpq button { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; width: 100%; height: 26px; padding: 0 6px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; color: #000; font: 400 13px/1 ${R}; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; }
.wr-mpq button b { flex: none; width: 18px; font-size: 11px; }
.wr-mpq button span { flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.wr-mpq button:hover, .wr-mpq button[data-on] { background: #000; color: #fff; }
.wr-mod[data-k="music"] .wr-mbox { width: min(380px, 100%); }
.wr-cb, .wr-zb { touch-action: manipulation; }
.wr-cb::after, .wr-zb::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -8px; }
@media (max-width: 640px), (max-height: 640px) {
    .wr-mod[data-k="os"] .wr-mbox { padding: 40px 10px 10px; }
    .wr-bzb { top: 9px; bottom: auto; left: 14px; right: 14px; }
}
@container (max-width: 480px) {
    .wr-cs button { width: 26px; height: 26px; }
    .wr-pgr { left: auto; right: 6px; bottom: 8px; transform: none; gap: 5px; padding: 3px 5px; font-size: 12px; }
    .wr-pgr .wr-bt { padding: 0 6px; }
    .wr-pgw { display: none; }
}

.wr-boot { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 80; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ac) 10%, #e4e4e4); animation: wr-bo .4s steps(4) 2s forwards; }
.wr-boot b { font: 400 18px/22px ${R}; font-weight: 700; }
.wr-pb { width: 230px; height: 16px; padding: 2px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; }
.wr-pb i { display: block; width: 0; height: 100%; background: #000; animation: wr-ld 1.6s steps(16) .2s forwards; }
.wr-ext { display: flex; gap: 10px; height: 28px; }
.wr-ext span { opacity: 0; animation: wr-ex .01s steps(1) forwards; }
@keyframes wr-ex { to { opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes wr-bo { to { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; } }
.wr-am { font-size: 14px; }
.wr-amh { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.wr-amh div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
.wr-amh b { font-size: 16px; }
.wr-amr { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 3px 0; border-bottom: 2px dotted #000; }
.wr-mem { height: 16px; margin: 10px 0; padding: 2px; border: 2px solid #000; }
.wr-mem i { display: block; height: 100%; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #000 0 2px, #fff 2px 3px); }
.wr-am small { opacity: .6; }
.wr-lk { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px; }
.wr-nt pre { margin: 8px 0 0; white-space: pre-wrap; font: 400 14px/18px ${R}; }
.wr-im p { margin-top: 8px; }
@container (max-width: 640px) {
    .wr-w2 { left: 4px !important; top: 4px !important; width: calc(100% - 8px) !important; }
    .wr-ics { grid-auto-columns: 70px; right: 80px; }
    .wr-ic { width: 66px; }
    .wr-ic .l { max-width: 64px; }
}

/* buttons shared everywhere (Send and Copy email now match) */
.wr-bt { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-sizing: border-box; height: 30px; padding: 0 14px; border: 2px solid #000; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; color: #000; background: #fff; font: 400 14px/1 ${R}; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
.wr-bt:hover { color: #fff; background: #000; }
.wr-bt:active { transform: translate(1px, 1px); }
.wr-bt[data-def] { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #fff, 0 0 0 4px #000; margin: 4px; }
/* piano */
.wr-keys2 { touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; -webkit-touch-callout: none; position: relative; display: flex; height: 120px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438; }
.wr-wk { flex: 1; padding: 0; border: 0; border-right: 2px solid #2a2438; cursor: pointer; background: #fff; transition: background .08s steps(1); }
.wr-wk:last-of-type { border-right: 0; }
.wr-wk[data-d] { background: var(--ac); }
.wr-bk2 { position: absolute; top: 0; width: 7.2%; height: 62%; padding: 0; border: 0; cursor: pointer; background: #2a2438; z-index: 1; }
.wr-bk2[data-d] { background: var(--ac); }
/* settings + music */
.wr-sr { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px 10px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 2px dashed rgba(42,36,56,.18); font-size: 14px; }
.wr-sr:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

/* chatbox + resume */
.wr-ch { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.wr-chh { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px dashed #000; }
.wr-chh .wr-avp { width: 40px; height: 40px; font-size: 16px; }
.wr-chh b { display: block; font: 400 10px/14px ${As}; }
.wr-chh em { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px; opacity: .7; }
.wr-chh em i { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: #3ccf7a; animation: wr-blink 2s steps(1) infinite; }
.wr-chl { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; height: 220px; max-height: 34vh; overflow: auto; padding: 8px; background: #f4f1ea repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,.035) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #000; overscroll-behavior: contain; }
.wr-chm { max-width: 88%; padding: 7px 9px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; color: #000; font: 400 14px/18px ${R}; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000; overflow-wrap: anywhere; animation: wr-chin .18s steps(3) backwards; }
.wr-chm[data-w="me"] { align-self: flex-start; }
.wr-chm[data-w="you"] { align-self: flex-end; background: var(--ac); color: var(--acink); }
.wr-chm q { display: block; quotes: none; }
.wr-chm cite { display: block; margin-top: 7px; font: 400 8px/12px ${As}; font-style: normal; }
.wr-chm cite span { display: block; margin-top: 3px; font: 400 12px/14px ${R}; opacity: .65; }
.wr-chm .wr-bt { display: flex; width: max-content; margin-top: 8px; height: 26px; font-size: 12px; }
.wr-chd { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; height: 18px; }
.wr-chd i { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #000; animation: wr-chb .9s steps(1) infinite; }
.wr-chd i:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .15s; }
.wr-chd i:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .3s; }
@keyframes wr-chb { 0%, 60%, 100% { transform: none; opacity: .35; } 30% { transform: translateY(-3px); opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes wr-chin { from { transform: translateY(6px); opacity: 0; } }
.wr-chq { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; max-height: 128px; overflow: auto; padding: 0 2px 2px 0; }
.wr-chq button { padding: 5px 8px; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; color: #000; font: 400 13px/16px ${R}; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000; touch-action: manipulation; }
.wr-chq button:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #000; color: #fff; }
.wr-chq button:active:not(:disabled) { transform: translate(1px, 1px); box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #000; }
.wr-chq button:disabled { opacity: .45; cursor: default; }
.wr-rt { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.wr-rt .wr-bt { height: 26px; padding: 0 10px; font-size: 12px; }
.wr-ra { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.wr-rp { padding: 14px 14px 12px; background: #fffdf6 repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 19px, rgba(90,160,255,.2) 19px 20px); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #000, 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3); }
.wr-rp h3 { margin: 0; font: 400 13px/20px ${As}; }
.wr-rp > em { display: block; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; opacity: .7; }
.wr-rs h4 { margin: 14px 0 4px; padding-bottom: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; font: 400 9px/14px ${As}; text-transform: uppercase; }
.wr-rr { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2px 10px; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; }
.wr-rr b { font-weight: 400; }
.wr-rr span { opacity: .65; font-size: 13px; }
.wr-rs ul { margin: 2px 0 0; padding-left: 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; }
.wr-rs p { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; }
.wr-mod[data-k="chat"] .wr-mbox { width: min(420px, 100%); }
.wr-mod[data-k="resume"] .wr-mbox { width: min(470px, 100%); }
.wr-w2[data-k="chat"] { width: 360px; }
.wr-w2[data-k="resume"] { width: 400px; }
.wr-w2 .wr-chl { height: 190px; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .wr-chm, .wr-chd i { animation: none; } }
.wr-seg { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }
.wr-seg button { padding: 3px 7px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; font: 400 12px/14px ${R}; color: #2a2438; background: #ece8f6; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438; }
.wr-seg button[data-on] { color: var(--acink); background: var(--ac); }
.wr-tgl { position: relative; width: 38px; height: 18px; padding: 0; border: 0; cursor: pointer; background: #cfc9df; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438; }
.wr-tgl i { position: absolute; left: 2px; top: 2px; width: 14px; height: 14px; background: #2a2438; transition: left .12s steps(2); }
.wr-tgl[data-on] { background: var(--ac); }
.wr-tgl[data-on] i { left: 22px; }
.wr-eq { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 4px; height: 54px; }
.wr-eq i { width: 8px; height: 6px; background: var(--ac); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #2a2438; }
.wr-eq[data-on] i { animation: wr-eqb .7s steps(5) infinite alternate; }
@keyframes wr-eqb { from { height: 6px; } to { height: 52px; } }
.wr-pxs { position: absolute; }
.wr-pxc { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; image-rendering: pixelated; image-rendering: crisp-edges; image-rendering: pixelated; touch-action: pan-y; }
.wr-kb { position: absolute; pointer-events: none; outline: none; }
.wr-kb:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--ac), 0 0 0 4px #fff; }
.wr-bar[data-l="top"] { left: 8px; right: 8px; top: 8px; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; }
.wr-bar[data-l="top"] .wr-mood { padding: 4px 6px; font-size: 7px; gap: 4px; }
.wr-cap[data-l="top"] { left: 50%; top: auto; bottom: 58px; transform: translateX(-50%); max-width: 86%; text-align: center; }
.wr-cb { background: #fff ${$l(`#000000`)} center / 10px 10px no-repeat; image-rendering: pixelated; }
.wr-cb:hover { background: #000 ${eu} center / 10px 10px no-repeat; }
.wr-zb::before { content: ""; position: absolute; right: 1px; bottom: 1px; width: 8px; height: 8px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; }
.wr-zb::after { left: 1px; top: 1px; width: 5px; height: 5px; border: 0; background: #000; }
.wr-zb:hover { background: #000; }
.wr-zb:hover::before { background: #000; border-color: #fff; }
.wr-zb:hover::after { background: #fff; }
.wr-stt { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-right: 6px; padding: 0 8px !important; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; white-space: nowrap; border: 2px solid #000; background: #fff; }
.wr-stt i { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #2fd06a; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #000; animation: wr-blink 1.6s steps(1) infinite; }
@container (max-width: 400px) { .wr-mn .wr-mi:nth-child(3) { display: none; } .wr-mn { font-size: 13px; } .wr-mi > button { padding: 0 5px; } .wr-stt { font-size: 10px; max-width: 100px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-right: 2px; padding: 0 5px !important; } }
@container (max-width: 520px) { .wr-stt { font-size: 11px; padding: 0 5px !important; } .wr-mn > span:last-child { display: none; } }
.wr-pwr { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 4px 9px 4px 6px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; background: #4a4e69; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #3b3629, inset 0 -3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18), inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.55); color: #e5e5e5; }
.wr-pwr:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, #4a4e69 78%, #e5e5e5); }
.wr-pwr:active { transform: translate(1px, 1px); }
.wr-pwr b { position: relative; width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 2px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 50%; box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: transparent; }
.wr-pwr b::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: -5px; width: 2px; height: 7px; background: #e5e5e5; }
.wr-pwr em { font: 400 8px/10px ${As}; font-style: normal; }

/* ---- v5: aquarium, small screens ---- */
.wr-aqv { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.wr-aqc { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 128 / 80; image-rendering: pixelated; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #8a6a44, 0 0 0 5px #000; background: #58b8d8; cursor: crosshair; touch-action: manipulation; }
.wr-aqv .wr-pvb { margin-top: 6px; }
.wr-aqv .wr-pvb .wr-bt { height: 30px; padding: 0 14px; font: 400 8px/10px ${As}; color: #000; background: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; }
.wr-aqv .wr-pvb .wr-bt:hover { color: #fff; background: #000; }
.wr-aqt { margin: 0; font: 400 15px/20px ${R}; }
.wr-mod[data-k="tank"] .wr-mbox { width: min(640px, 100%); }
.wr-mbox { box-sizing: border-box; }
@media (max-width: 640px), (max-height: 640px) {
    .wr-mod { padding: 6px; }
    .wr-mod[data-k="os"] .wr-mbox { padding: 40px 10px 10px; border-radius: 16px; }
    .wr-bzb { left: 16px; right: 16px; top: 9px; bottom: auto; }
    .wr-pwr { padding: 3px 7px 3px 5px; }
    .wr-pwr em { font-size: 7px; }
}

